// Into flooded pumpworks by the service door on its east wall, up over the pump machinery (W held climbs it)
// onto the iron gallery, unhurt. Layout evidence (PR #8, sites.rs; see REFINE-movement.md): walking on west
// along the gallery, it ends about 35 m in with a 7.5 m drop to the floor (16-25 hp; 10 m and 43 hp from
// further on), before the rope that hangs from it at 28 m, so a careful mole can't get down to the chest
// unhurt from this door; the flood fill (tests/found_places.rs) ignores gravity and counts it reachable.
